{"3474390": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BOILED", "steam_appid": 3474390, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He’ll pay any price to achieve his goal—and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> The illustrations were produced by a team of artists under the direction of Teodor Manolov (Dr. Frank).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a9f3ff240cd9563f9cb1cc93540a911e.avif?t=1788072186\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters—from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use your skills to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/3717851ea645cfce471801bc7463721d.avif?t=1788072186\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking—or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running an errand for an old friend inadvertently drags ex-gang leader Dan into a brutal smuggler war in a border town.<br>He’ll pay any price to achieve his goal—and make everyone else pay, too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No mercy. No compromise. At any cost.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> The illustrations were produced by a team of artists under the direction of Teodor Manolov (Dr. Frank).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/a9f3ff240cd9563f9cb1cc93540a911e.avif?t=1788072186\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/68ef654e2c9eb7e988cb77a709b14453.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Large, dynamic levels</strong> offer tactical freedom and adrenaline-pumping encounters—from luxury hotel penthouses to ancient temples.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break windows, slide across furniture, and use your skills to strike fast and clean.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Catch enemies off guard. Stay sharp. Return fire with style.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/d4447c1f66f25dd103999ef433a3b6a3.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/3717851ea645cfce471801bc7463721d.avif?t=1788072186\" width=780 height=82 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We’re taking you into a <strong>linear story with layered perception</strong>. The events remain the same, but your interpretation of them changes based on how you engage with the world.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.poster.avif?t=1788072186\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.webm?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/extras/cad537123d85b8ee53cfb44681829630.mp4?t=1788072186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose to spend time talking—or skip the chatter. The story will adapt to your depth of attention, transforming your experience from a gritty gangster thriller into something much deeper.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9 Days in the life of Dan - a former bootlegger gang leader</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>9 handcrafted, large-scale levels</strong>, each in a distinct location (no AI or procedural generation)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whole Wild West town for you to explore, full of stories and mysteries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Original electronic soundtrack</strong>, rhythmically angry and composed exclusively for the game</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "America, 1925. A simple errand for an old friend pulls ex-gang leader Dan into a violent smuggler war on the border. A narrative-driven, adrenaline-pumping top-down shooter, set in the 1920s Old West.", "supported_languages": "English, Simplified Chinese, Russian, Japanese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/fbacecb2de11f23a6aa375b9f202474e828c1780/header.jpg?t=1788072186", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/aaaa116a63e79b57a007ebdce8fb3d68cdbfed63/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788072186", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3474390/aaaa116a63e79b57a007ebdce8fb3d68cdbfed63/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788072186", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel core i3 1115<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> nVidia GTX 660ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB a